[{"answer":"My name's Dan Pearman","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/1.mp3"},{"answer":"and I'd like to talk about the work of Pedal Power,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/2.mp3"},{"answer":"a small charity based mainly in the UK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/3.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll be giving our contact details at the end,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/4.mp3"},{"answer":"if anyone would like to find out more about how to support us.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/5.mp3"},{"answer":"But first, how the charity began.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/6.mp3"},{"answer":"I got the idea of exporting bicycles to developing countries while I was in Ecuador.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/7.mp3"},{"answer":"I went there in 1993 just after graduating from university.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/8.mp3"},{"answer":"After three years of studying, I wanted adventure.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/9.mp3"},{"answer":"I loved travelling,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/10.mp3"},{"answer":"so I decided to join a voluntary organisation","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/11.mp3"},{"answer":"and was sent to Ecuador to carry out land surveys.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/12.mp3"},{"answer":"The project came to an end after five years","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/13.mp3"},{"answer":"and when I returned to the UK in 1998,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/14.mp3"},{"answer":"I started planning Pedal Power.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Where I lived in Ecuador was a very rural area.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/16.mp3"},{"answer":"My neighbour had the only bicycle in the village,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/17.mp3"},{"answer":"whereas everyone else walked everywhere.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/18.mp3"},{"answer":"My neighbour's business was unusually successful,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/19.mp3"},{"answer":"and for years I couldn't understand why.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/20.mp3"},{"answer":"Then I realised having a bike meant he could get where he wanted to go without much trouble.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Other local carpenters could only accept jobs in a 3 kilometre radius,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/22.mp3"},{"answer":"so no matter how skilled they were, they could never do as many jobs as my neighbour.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/23.mp3"},{"answer":"At Pedal Power, we collect second-hand bikes in the UK","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/24.mp3"},{"answer":"and send them to some of the poorest regions in the world.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/25.mp3"},{"answer":"When we distribute bikes overseas, we don't give them away for free.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/26.mp3"},{"answer":"We'd like to, but long term that doesn't really help the local economy.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/27.mp3"},{"answer":"The demand for bikes is enormous, which makes them very expensive locally.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/28.mp3"},{"answer":"So we sell them for 5% of the normal price.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/29.mp3"},{"answer":"But in order to continue operating,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/30.mp3"},{"answer":"we need to have a constant supply of bikes which we send out every six months.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/31.mp3"},{"answer":"One example of a town that's received bicycles from Pedal Power is Rivas.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/32.mp3"},{"answer":"It was the first place I sent a full container of bicycles to.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/33.mp3"},{"answer":"Most people there now own a bicycle.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/34.mp3"},{"answer":"The local economy has developed so much,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/35.mp3"},{"answer":"you wouldn't recognise it as the same place.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/36.mp3"},{"answer":"In fact, there are more bikes than on the streets of Amsterdam, if you've ever been there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/37.mp3"},{"answer":"But Pedal Power still needs your help.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/38.mp3"},{"answer":"You may have read about some of our recent problems in the British media.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/39.mp3"},{"answer":"In August 2000, we simply ran out of money.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/40.mp3"},{"answer":"We had containers of bikes ready to send,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/41.mp3"},{"answer":"but no money to pay the bills.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/42.mp3"},{"answer":"It was a terrible situation.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/43.mp3"},{"answer":"We managed to ensure the bikes went out on time,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/44.mp3"},{"answer":"but the other problems carried on for several months.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/45.mp3"},{"answer":"Fortunately, in October 2001,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/46.mp3"},{"answer":"we won an Enterprise Award which helped us enormously.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/47.mp3"},{"answer":"We invested 15 of the 75,000 pound prize money to help secure our future.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/48.mp3"},{"answer":"Winning the award helped raise our profile,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/49.mp3"},{"answer":"and the money enabled us to pay all our shipping costs,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/50.mp3"},{"answer":"which represent our greatest expense.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/51.mp3"},{"answer":"Pedal Power changes lives -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/52.mp3"},{"answer":"when someone gets a bicycle from us, they see a 14% increase in their income.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/53.mp3"},{"answer":"We're currently looking to invest in computers","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/54.mp3"},{"answer":"so that our office staff can do an even better job.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/55.mp3"},{"answer":"Because of our work, people in a number of countries now have a better standard of living -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/56.mp3"},{"answer":"so far we've provided 46,000 people with bikes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/57.mp3"},{"answer":"But we'd like to send more, at least 50,000 by the end of the year.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/58.mp3"},{"answer":"Now there are many ways in which you can support the work of Pedal Power,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/59.mp3"},{"answer":"not just by taking a bike to a collection in your area.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/60.mp3"},{"answer":"I should also like to say if you do have a bike to donate,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/61.mp3"},{"answer":"it doesn't matter what condition it's in.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/62.mp3"},{"answer":"If we can't repair it, we'll strip it down for spare parts.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/63.mp3"},{"answer":"Of course, to do that we always need tools, which are expensive to buy,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/64.mp3"},{"answer":"so we welcome any that you can give.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/65.mp3"},{"answer":"Also, you could help by contacting the voluntary staff at our offices,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/66.mp3"},{"answer":"they'll be able to suggest activities you could organise to bring in funds for us.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/67.mp3"},{"answer":"People do all kinds of things - including, of course, sponsored bike rides.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/68.mp3"},{"answer":"Also, we're always interested to hear of other places that would benefit from receiving a consignment of bikes,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/69.mp3"},{"answer":"and welcome suggestions from people who've been to developing regions on their travels.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/70.mp3"},{"answer":"We hope that by talking on radio programmes like this,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/71.mp3"},{"answer":"we will be able to raise public awareness,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/72.mp3"},{"answer":"which will lead to government organisations also giving us regular financial support,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/73.mp3"},{"answer":"something that we really need.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/74.mp3"},{"answer":"If you'd like some more information about where to donate an old bicycle","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/75.mp3"},{"answer":"or offer help in other ways, please contact...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-2-part-2-2023-08-05-19-32-33/76.mp3"}]
